Raising your mindstar in the air you channel a bright flash of light through it. Any creatures in radius [2, 3, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] is blinded for [3, 4, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] turns.

If any foe in melee range is blinded by the effect you quickly use that to your advantage by striking them with a blow of your main hand weapon doing [149%, 169%, 185%, 198%, 210% (TL1-5)] damage.

If you do not have a one handed weapon and a mindstar equiped, but have them in your off set, you instantly automatically switch. The wild psionic powers are incompatible with the focused nature of psiblades.
